sequenceDiagram
  participant Student
  participant Frame
  participant Service
  participant DAO
  participant MySQL
  Student->>Frame: Submit registration
  Frame->>Service: register(...)
  Service->>Service: validate
  Service->>DAO: register(...)
  DAO->>MySQL: PreparedStatement INSERT
  MySQL-->>DAO: success or unique violation
  DAO-->>Frame: result
  Frame-->>Student: confirmation/error
